   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> »hyperion« </h2>",
   "body": "<p>With »hyperion 300/500/700«, you have a measuring device for almost all tool systems and are therefore always a decisive step ahead of the competition.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ru/company/contact\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Request now</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1:1 expert meeting</a></p>",
